# Pairs with RestoreNeverTorn. A routing activation re-resolves the alias but
# keeps the shard map it had cached, so after a cutover it routes the shadow
# by the previous copy's map.
MODULE: RestoreNeverTornRefreshKeepsMap
TARGET: RestoreNeverTorn
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a routing refresh re-reads the alias but not the map
PERTURBS: Refresh

--- FIND
    /\ route' = [alias |-> alias, map |-> map]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the cached map is kept.
    /\ route' = [alias |-> alias, map |-> route.map]
--- END
